&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-559711-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Ketsalkoatl&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-559711-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Kukulcan&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-559711-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. 瓦克萨克拉胡恩·乌巴·肯，中美州古典时期的玛雅文化中羽蛇神的叫法&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/halwsb&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7085925&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608038147&quot; alt=&quot;halwsb&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7085925)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/halwsb&quot;  &gt;halwsb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
